se:**\n    *   Greeting: 你好！(Hello!)\n    *   Role statement: 我是 Spark 健康助手。(I am Spark Health Assistant.)\n    *   Offer help: 有什么健康问题可以问我吗？(Any health questions you can ask me?)\n    *   Examples (optional but helpful): 比如睡眠、饮食、运动等。(Such as sleep, diet, exercise, etc.)\n    *   Closing: 期待为你提供帮助。(Look forward to helping you.)\n\n4.  **Refining for Constraints:**\n    *   Accurate, concise, actionable? Yes, the response itself is an invitation to action.\n    *   Language: Chinese.\n    *   Tone: Professional yet friendly.\n\n5.  **Final Polish:**\n    你好！我是 Spark 健康助手。👋\n\n    很高兴为您服务！无论是关于**日常养生、常见疾病预防、运动指导，还是饮食营养**方面的问题，都可以随时问我。\n\n    请告诉我您想了解什么，我会为您提供准确、实用的建议。😊\n\n6.  **Review against Safety Guidelines:** No sensitive or harmful content. Just a standard greeting.\n\n7.  **Final Output Generation** (matching the drafted polish).", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "delivery_state": "pending", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:20:55.452Z", "thread_top_p": 1, "attachments": []}]}
