\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\nOpto\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3mg （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。"}], "thread_temperature": 0.6, "kind": "text", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "thread_top_p": 1, "delivery_state": "pending", "tombstone": false, "thread_max_tokens": 32768, "created_at": "2026-04-25T14:50:36.229Z", "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "thread_role_prompt": "", "client_message_id": "D707D6A1-FD82-4A2C-BED9-36469754D52C", "model_name": "user", "thread_max_messages": 20, "reasoning_expanded": false, "role": "user", "thread_id": "399FE10E-3CB8-431E-9481-BD7A58639187", "content": "报告抽取 创建任务"}]}
