INFO 2026-04-25 15:40:23,232 accounts.api_io [request_id=1EBD0EDF-9ECA-492A-85B6-CEA73A0C74F1] HTTP 响应摘要: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ status=200 duration_ms=23 bytes=2614 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "POST, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"messages": [{"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "📸 皮肤照片上传入口已为您展示，请您按照以下要求拍摄上传后我会为您分析：\n1. 优先选择自然光下拍摄，避免灯光反光或阴影遮挡患处\n2. 建议上传2张：1张患处局部特写（清晰展现皮疹/泛红/破损等细节）、1张带正常皮肤的大范围对比图\n3. 上传时可以补充说明症状：比如是否痒/痛、出现多久了、有没有用过药膏之类的信息，分析会更准确哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "c73f96d5-ff43-4653-ab1a-96d01bc8810b", "server_message_id": "112f2284-7810-4a74-b897-aa5f30dd0de8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:41:34.042000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:23.218101+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请您点击卡片上传皮疹部位的清晰照片，最好同时补充以下信息帮您进一步判断：\n1. 疹子出现多久了、有没有瘙痒/疼痛/发热等伴随症状\n2. 近期有没有接触新的护肤品、食物、药物，或者去过草丛/树林等特殊环境\n3. 本身有没有过敏史、其他基础疾病", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "1fbf3f00-c423-4690-9bf1-955bf882d5e6", "server_message_id": "2dc4203e-e337-41ee-b18a-f349733db5d9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:22.909000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:23.226746+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"text": "show_custom_message_card", "type": "toolName", "id": "5FFE2BDC-425F-4846-93F8-86E4F597E644"}, {"text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（skin_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "toolContent", "id": "C4AA8670-641F-4419-B674-A98F12337476"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card", "type": "operationalState", "id": "2B60ABE3-B64A-43F0-B2D1-4E4B677FF77A"}, {"type": "oper