INFO 2026-04-25 15:40:45,646 accounts.api_io [request_id=7A3BD453-CD11-4F99-91C8-CB16BAA97816] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc3MTMzMTQ5LCJpYXQiOjE3NzcxMzEzNDksImp0aSI6ImYyNDM1ZDlkYWUxMzRkNGU5YzY1YTE1MjdlZTUzOTEwIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.HW4UVJRKBX0ukAUqIfyTmefkoMMbZDZG0oFQVYKiTwM", "X-Request-Id": "7A3BD453-CD11-4F99-91C8-CB16BAA97816", "Content-Length": "2534"} body={"messages": [{"content": "📸 皮肤照片上传入口已为您展示，请您按照以下要求拍摄上传后我会为您分析：\n1. 优先选择自然光下拍摄，避免灯光反光或阴影遮挡患处\n2. 建议上传2张：1张患处局部特写（清晰展现皮疹/泛红/破损等细节）、1张带正常皮肤的大范围对比图\n3. 上传时可以补充说明症状：比如是否痒/痛、出现多久了、有没有用过药膏之类的信息，分析会更准确哦~", "attachments": [], "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "delivery_state": "pending", "reasoning_expanded": false, "role": "assistant", "thread_id": "FDB2A974-013E-4F8D-9314-A1426FAAABF4", "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:41:34.042Z", "kind": "text", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "thread_max_messages": 20, "tombstone": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "client_message_id": "C73F96D5-FF43-4653-AB1A-96D01BC8810B", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_role_prompt": ""}, {"content": "从照片看是大片水肿性红色风团样皮疹，高度符合**荨麻疹（风疹块）**的典型表现，多由过敏诱发，给您分情况给出建议：\n\n### 紧急处理（先做）\n1.  如果现在同时有胸闷、嗓子发紧、呼吸困难、头晕心慌，立刻打120急救，这是严重过敏反应的信号\n2.  只有皮疹+瘙痒的话，优先口服二代抗组胺药（氯雷他定/西替利嗪/依巴斯汀任选一种，按说明书吃，多数人1-2小时内皮疹会逐渐消退）\n3.  别抓、别用热水烫洗，暂时不吃海鲜、辛辣、酒精类食物，停用近期新加的护肤品/可疑药物\n\n### 后续建议\n- 服药后1~2小时皮疹完全消退、没有其他不舒服，可以先观察，若后续反复复发建议到皮肤科查过敏原\n- 要是吃药后皮疹没退、瘙痒加重，或者出现发热、关节痛、皮疹超过24小时不消退，及时去皮肤科就诊，排查感染性荨麻疹或其他红斑性皮肤病", "attachments": [], "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "delivery_state": "pending", "reasoning_expanded": false, "role": "assistant", "thread_id": "7F0741C6-FCC4-4534-9D9F-F8885D00BB04", "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:45.498Z", "kind": "text", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "thread_max_messages": 20, "tombstone": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "client_message_id": "C7BBB974-D16C-4EDD-A959-D75F83726887", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_role_prompt": ""}]}
