INFO 2026-04-25 16:09:10,770 accounts.api_io [request_id=29A29B2F-7E95-4793-9933-3BAD26D65B64] HTTP 响应摘要: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ status=200 duration_ms=20 bytes=2504 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "POST, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"messages": [{"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "📸 皮肤照片上传入口已为您展示，请您按照以下要求拍摄上传后我会为您分析：\n1. 优先选择自然光下拍摄，避免灯光反光或阴影遮挡患处\n2. 建议上传2张：1张患处局部特写（清晰展现皮疹/泛红/破损等细节）、1张带正常皮肤的大范围对比图\n3. 上传时可以补充说明症状：比如是否痒/痛、出现多久了、有没有用过药膏之类的信息，分析会更准确哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "c73f96d5-ff43-4653-ab1a-96d01bc8810b", "server_message_id": "112f2284-7810-4a74-b897-aa5f30dd0de8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:41:34.042000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:10.758667+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请您点击上方的拍照卡片，对准药盒的正面（有药品名称、规格的一面）拍摄清晰照片，我会帮您核对药品信息、用法用量，以及和当前处方的匹配度~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "18d1f884-d779-42f8-bb9d-aad7141ef50b", "server_message_id": "f1b4e7ca-e292-45d3-8bf6-2cf153fc310a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:10.522000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:10.764564+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "65E802B2-E63C-4AB5-AFDD-A2CB64BCCDEA", "type": "toolName", "text": "show_custom_message_card"}, {"id": "D818E9EE-9EC1-4383-8AB1-9F54EF59138C", "type": "toolContent", "text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（medicine_box_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。"}, {"id": "309FE71C-461B-4C65-AA63-A03F74CB1AA7", "type": "operationalState", "text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card"}, {"id": "4D16831B-0612-4CF9-B32F-0D56D28D46A6", "type": "operationalDescription", "text": "已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（medicine_box_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。"}, {"id": "08B589B0-FF12-4D40-AB83-377DB8EC1322", "type": "capture_message_card", "text": "{\"cardType\":\"medicine_box_photo\"}"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}]}}
