INFO 2026-04-25 16:09:35,485 accounts.api_io [request_id=FC0871B7-EC8E-4598-834A-7E3623A97D12] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc3MTM1MDg1LCJpYXQiOjE3NzcxMzMyODUsImp0aSI6ImIyZWIzOGI1ZTQwYjQ5M2M5MmI3YTI5YjAzOTQzZTNiIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.GjIWxZOCY6P3rT_iKXp9b0ztzJh7b79WT_SqNB2Gb2A", "X-Request-Id": "FC0871B7-EC8E-4598-834A-7E3623A97D12", "Content-Length": "2702"} body={"messages": [{"tombstone": false, "role": "assistant", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "C73F96D5-FF43-4653-AB1A-96D01BC8810B", "thread_top_p": 1, "content": "📸 皮肤照片上传入口已为您展示，请您按照以下要求拍摄上传后我会为您分析：\n1. 优先选择自然光下拍摄，避免灯光反光或阴影遮挡患处\n2. 建议上传2张：1张患处局部特写（清晰展现皮疹/泛红/破损等细节）、1张带正常皮肤的大范围对比图\n3. 上传时可以补充说明症状：比如是否痒/痛、出现多久了、有没有用过药膏之类的信息，分析会更准确哦~", "kind": "text", "reasoning_expanded": false, "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:41:34.042Z", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "thread_id": "FDB2A974-013E-4F8D-9314-A1426FAAABF4", "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_role_prompt": "", "attachments": [], "delivery_state": "pending"}, {"tombstone": false, "role": "assistant", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "FA69C952-7F9C-4E7F-B039-9E4E0EF7A983", "thread_top_p": 1, "content": "如果是日常皮肤补水保湿，给您一套通用且高效的方法，不同肤质可以按需调整：\n### 基础步骤（干皮/中性皮适用）\n1. **清洁：选温和氨基酸洁面，避免皂基类（尤其是晨间可以只用温水洗，减少油脂被过度清洁\n2. **补水：洗完脸30秒内拍爽肤水/化妆水，干燥时可以湿敷3分钟（不要超过5分钟，避免反而脱水）\n3. **锁水：后续涂精华+乳液/面霜，干皮选封闭性强的面霜（含神经酰胺、角鲨烷、凡士林成分优先），油皮选清爽型乳液\n4. **加强：每周敷2~3次补水面膜，每次15分钟，敷完立刻涂面霜锁水\n\n### 针对性技巧\n- **敏感肌**：避开含酒精、香精、果酸的产品，优先选医用修护敷料/保湿霜，减少复杂叠加\n- **油皮混油皮**：不要过度清洁，选清爽控油型保湿乳，避免闷痘\n- **急救补水**：如果皮肤干燥爆皮，可以厚涂一层保湿面霜敷15分钟，再擦去多余部分，立刻缓解干燥\n\n如果是其他部位（比如眼部、唇部）的保湿需求，也可以告诉我，给你更针对性的方案~", "kind": "text", "reasoning_expanded": false, "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:35.378Z", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "thread_id": "7F0741C6-FCC4-4534-9D9F-F8885D00BB04", "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_role_prompt": "", "attachments": [], "delivery_state": "pending"}]}
