INFO 2026-04-25 16:22:33,832 accounts.api_io [request_id=C798E07E-3851-4C30-96D9-3EF449020BCB] HTTP 响应摘要: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ status=200 duration_ms=19 bytes=2313 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "POST, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"messages": [{"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "📸 皮肤照片上传入口已为您展示，请您按照以下要求拍摄上传后我会为您分析：\n1. 优先选择自然光下拍摄，避免灯光反光或阴影遮挡患处\n2. 建议上传2张：1张患处局部特写（清晰展现皮疹/泛红/破损等细节）、1张带正常皮肤的大范围对比图\n3. 上传时可以补充说明症状：比如是否痒/痛、出现多久了、有没有用过药膏之类的信息，分析会更准确哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "c73f96d5-ff43-4653-ab1a-96d01bc8810b", "server_message_id": "112f2284-7810-4a74-b897-aa5f30dd0de8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:41:34.042000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:33.822849+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "0f40191e-83e8-40b6-bc54-a297d74aee6f", "server_message_id": "8fc61886-ccdb-4c13-b3b4-832d27ccfb30", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:33.660000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:33.828349+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"fileId": 327, "type": "image", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260425/BD50D9CE-563C-4B45-BC11-BBA75A87835F/IMG_1825.jpeg", "text": "⑦\nins fege\n电磁门頭\nCiub\n9铝\nC2\n直流天别电奶\n取走包裹请\n24Hk\n单舱洗姝 洗烘效率團\n粤系然醇霎衣盟无注付区\n9999%量\n智能投放洗涤\n高效洁净不交叉\n单洗烘区\n说热效率提升2004双能同流同；\n双洗烘\n独在双系统分区不溫流更卫生\n健康守护洗烘更洁净\n单向进水 放立牌水互不干找\n②\n为什么这择一机双洗烘？\n一台顶2合", "id": "88DE22E0-CAEE-4577-A2BC-085AC2AF2E60", "fullCacheKey": "bd50d9ce-563c-4b45-bc11-bba75a87835f/IMG_1825.jpeg", "fileMd5": "6043d9b74d98d1c12a0fba40a506c8db"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}]}}
