null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请问你是有具体的健康相关问题想要咨询吗？可以详细描述你的情况，比如身体不适的症状、饮食/运动相关的疑问等，我会帮你解答~", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "ad7528fb-c10e-48a6-99d9-1a1f9b8d02b8", "server_message_id": "45cc8534-1272-46aa-b109-4a1a7573bcb9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:39:26.797000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:39:26.834399+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你看看你吗86", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "376d43bb-7cd8-4a17-8fed-4032e6f638af", "server_message_id": "3c4141c1-c9b5-43bd-b729-35d5de8ab435", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:40:52.424000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:40:52.602099+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我没能理解你想表达的意思哦😊 如果是有健康相关的问题，比如关于你之前记录的结膜炎用药疑问、眼部不适咨询，或者其他健康需求，都可以明确描述出来，我会尽力为你提供准确的建议~", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "e62e65c2-ed69-48d5-aa9d-1d42c45ec806", "server_message_id": "caf45536-dcd7-45df-93ad-0e473c0a9d14", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:40:56.523000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:40:56.578906+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "最近我在用什么药", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "ce55f49d-079f-4d79-97db-be8faa0e0088", "server_message_id": "025c3e9d-23b8-447f-a2b1-de0a4b53ff8a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:43:45.511000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:43:45.578180+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "根据你近期的用药记录，你目前正在使用两种滴眼液，均是针对结膜炎的治疗，用法如下：\n1. 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）：每次1滴，每日2次\n2. 普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）：每次1滴，每日4次\n\n用药注意：两种滴眼液使用时建议间隔5~10分钟，滴药时瓶口不要接触眼周皮肤/睫毛，避免污染药液；用药期间如果出现眼部刺痛加重、红肿瘙痒不缓解等情况，及时停药复诊。", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "380a3d6e-33a0-4703-9528-c4e15c96d279", "server_message_id": "bec3587a-455c-450b-baa2-e14c11b0f1fc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:43:51.378000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:43:51.684913+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你再看看 我最近用睡眠药", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "edd5ccea-5067-40b8-87be-be804e0e6542", "server_message_id": "51644026-d463-4cd5-b3f4-a9e8104d271a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:44:06.185000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:44:06.428547+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "目前我这边没有记录到你近期的睡眠类药物使用信息哦，你可以补充说下具体的药物名称、用法用量，或者目前的睡眠困扰（比如入睡难、早醒、用药后有没有不适等），我可以给你对应的用药注意和睡眠调整建议~\n\n如果是首次准备用助眠药物，也提醒你：镇静催眠类属于处方药，一定要先经医生评估睡眠问题的原因后，遵医嘱使用，不要自行购买服用哦。", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "a4c9933b-fc98-4f75-937c-434784931023", "server_message_id": "5e316fae-f813-4d20-9296-b6652f7cd849", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:44:10.368000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:44:10.426939+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "啦啦啦", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "f174f0bf-d592-43f5-8647-4c0a0fe2b083", "server_message_id": "63d3aac8-f708-4408-a8b8-c1d5337be512", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:45:40.198000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:45:40.247369+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "看来你心情不错呀😊 如果之后有健康相关的疑问，不管是用药注意、睡眠调整、饮食保健还是身体不适咨询，都可以随时和我说哦~", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "1625806e-91e8-4482-964f-b909d3b1a624", "server_message_id": "9e54b701-286f-422a-ba78-bafe8d54fcd9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:45:42.852000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:45:42.888073+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "啊啊啊啊尺寸", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "1a7e9c2f-6dd6-4011-917b-bce3530730c2", "server_message_id": "784245da-ebd4-4847-8345-79558bea1ec8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:46:40.739000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:46:40.963574+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我暂时没有理解你说的内容哦~ 如果是和健康相关的问题，比如用药剂量、医疗用品尺寸选择、身体发育相关疑问等，都可以更详细地描述你的需求，我会尽力给你准确的解答~", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "206451b9-31d1-4de4-9071-470873682866", "server_message_id": "f2bb7826-3e27-4b4a-922f-aacfddae3347", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:46:44.720000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:46:45.258455+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好意思了不给", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "6a64fb3e-9f6d-4ea3-86d5-0d3ca8143b11", "server_message_id": "ad860fa9-f1a2-4e14-bf88-dd816bc58d4d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:58:20.600000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:58:20.771910+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "看起来你可能是对之前的回复有不满意的地方~ 如果你有具体的健康需求、疑问，或者想要查询的信息，可以明确和我说，我会尽力为你提供准确、实用的帮助哒😊", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "4981e9e7-ae65-4063-868d-f23ac6e69be8", "server_message_id": "48e6fd02-3723-4073-b260-8b89fe5bb479", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:58:24.824000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:58:24.859312+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "88998", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "aa4d5a54-4601-49d6-a652-2bf0f5ab8063", "server_message_id": "6f9b9155-5b9d-4870-9766-c6289bb7178c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:59:20.440000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:59:20.512851+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我没有get到你说的内容哦~如果有健康相关的问题，比如疾病护理、用药咨询、饮食运动建议、身体不适应对这类需求，都可以把具体情况告诉我，我会帮你解答~", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "29a2ef2f-f630-4624-9790-c5131e146c7c", "server_message_id": "106fc9ec-2b6d-4e68-9ce0-a0f9ca258e92", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T07:59:27.008000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T07:59:27.049429+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈 接你", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "a40ea816-f487-466b-9ac0-f3f240e11cd5", "server_message_id": "8162c158-84e9-4734-be85-e5426f0c7a91", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:00:44.417000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:00:44.539108+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "吧宝贝", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "b678801f-707b-45fc-95ee-4b83a41591d5", "server_message_id": "bd4e668a-a0e2-47bf-b6ed-bd28985a77a1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:01:16.020000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:01:16.183981+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "如果你有健康相关的问题，比如不适症状咨询、用药疑问、饮食/运动调整需求等，可以随时告诉我具体情况，我会尽力为你提供准确实用的建议~", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "964efe6b-08b4-40c0-bc7d-35bfe67faf18", "server_message_id": "d0906d76-2d0a-485e-9d89-0e56b2e1a9fd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:01:21.159000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:01:21.400273+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你不不不不", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "40f48ead-7a88-4b9f-af0d-468af0d536e7", "server_message_id": "479d8ba0-97eb-42e5-941f-29490bdbbf73", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:02:44.092000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:02:44.350016+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "看起来你好像是在调整输入内容~ 要是你有具体的健康相关疑问，不管是症状应对、用药注意、生活习惯调整这类问题，都可以把具体情况说清楚，我会帮你给出靠谱的建议哒😊", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "4889d4f9-7d2d-4d09-9a7d-7df88c1d2285", "server_message_id": "77ec2130-fd90-40c8-a256-9da17b822102", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:02:48.295000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:02:48.332573+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "39fd7901-e39d-4745-ab10-7ebf6639c459", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好了没有", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "a136cf95-6fd4-45ce-bbcc-