INFO 2026-04-25 16:25:46,208 accounts.api_io [request_id=35E16BC2-CF30-410D-BE8F-15403A4B7CDD] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=10 bytes=25924 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjRUMTA6NTg6MjYuNTk2NTQ1KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxNjA2In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "242d7be2-6454-47fb-82da-aa14163a9e57", "server_message_id": "7a4d9011-5641-4780-b78f-6b4921c12960", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:34.372000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:35.068288+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊 从近期的病历记录看到你正在遵医嘱使用盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液、普拉洛芬滴眼液治疗结膜炎，给你提几个用药和护理的小建议，帮助更快恢复：\n1. 用药注意：两种滴眼液使用时至少间隔5~10分钟，滴药时瓶口别碰到眼睛或手，避免污染药液；如果之后症状缓解，也别自行停药，建议先找眼科医生复查后再调整用药。\n2. 日常护理：最近别戴隐形眼镜，别用手揉眼睛，毛巾、枕套这些接触眼睛的物品勤换洗暴晒；尽量避开花粉、尘螨、烟雾这类刺激物，减少用眼时间，多休息。\n如果有眼睛红肿加重、疼痛、视力下降的情况，要及时去眼科复诊哦。\n请问你还有其他健康相关的问题需要咨询吗？", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "2c875da0-03b3-47fa-8c4d-3c4e872babe6", "server_message_id": "88364025-164c-4ec7-80c1-3e88f4387515", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:42.483000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:42.467627+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "还有呢？", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "779beaed-a628-4d80-9a74-a281aa9cc061", "server_message_id": "0edc1724-bdf6-41c7-9dcd-6a925054d271", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:46.821000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:48.453029+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "再给你补充一些更细节的注意事项，帮你更好地恢复、避免结膜炎反复：\n### 用药相关\n1. 普拉洛芬滴眼液每天4次尽量均匀间隔，比如早、中、晚、睡前各1次；盐酸氮卓斯汀早晚各1次就好，别漏用也别自行加量。如果不小心滴多了1次也不用慌，偶尔过量不会有明显刺激，后续按正常频次用就行。\n2. 如果用药后感觉短时间内轻微刺痛、痒，几秒就缓解是正常反应；要是持续红肿、烧灼感超过10分钟，可能是对药物不耐受，先停药及时找医生调整。\n\n### 生活禁忌\n1. 饮食上最近别吃太辛辣、过甜的食物，也别喝酒、喝浓咖啡，这些都可能加重眼部充血和炎症反应。\n2. 发病期间别去公共泳池、浴场，也尽量别和家人共用毛巾、洗脸盆，避免交叉传染。\n3. 如果是过敏性结膜炎，最近尽量少去花草多的地方，家里的床单被罩每周换一次，打扫卫生尽量用湿抹布，减少扬尘刺激。\n\n### 恢复判断\n如果用药3~5天后眼红、痒、异物感、分泌物多这些症状明显减轻，就继续用满疗程；要是超过1周还没好转，或者出现怕光、看东西模糊、眼屎特别多糊住眼睛的情况，一定要马上复诊，排查是不是合并了其他类型的感染。", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "aa524a5a-4ea7-45cc-b329-1e000015b299", "server_message_id": "cf02cd9e-296a-426e-9287-af34e737f280", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:58.344000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:40:58.509422+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这个是什么", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "bf48ac8f-c8f5-47df-a0ba-c8830718e5d7", "server_message_id": "0266d359-4e07-4fee-848e-f35ec12fe673", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:41:28.826000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:41:29.124334+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "8350BFD8-0B63-4F77-863E-F64C8724BB15", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260424/DC2ADC7A-3762-4367-9A2E-A758955E4F86/IMG_1804.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 313, "fileMd5": "cd1abffedd7ca0d07515fa23824b7574", "fullCacheKey": "dc2adc7a-3762-4367-9a2e-a758955e4f86/IMG_1804.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "从皮疹形态来看，这是**荨麻疹（风团）**的典型表现，属于过敏反应的一种，结合你之前有过敏性结膜炎的病史，说明你近期属于过敏高发状态，大概率是接触了过敏原（比如花粉、尘螨、特定食物/药物、蚊虫叮咬等）诱发的。\n\n先给你可执行的处理建议：\n1.  先对症止痒：别抓挠，越抓红肿会越重，可以局部涂炉甘石洗剂缓解痒感，如果痒得明显、红疹还在增多，没有药物过敏的话，可以口服氯雷他定/西替利嗪这类抗过敏药，按说明书吃1片/天即可。\n2.  先规避可疑过敏原：最近暂时别吃海鲜、芒果、辛辣刺激的食物，穿宽松纯棉的衣服，避免接触之前没碰过的日化用品，如果近期新增了药物也可以先排查是不是药疹。\n3.  出现以下情况立刻去急诊：如果红疹范围持续扩大，同时出现呼吸困难、喉咙发紧、头晕心慌、腹痛的情况，说明是严重过敏反应，需要马上就医。\n\n如果用药后2~3天红疹还反复出现，建议到皮肤科就诊，必要时可以查过敏原明确诱因。", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "f66862c0-3b87-48c1-87d8-e6af2dd81f0b", "server_message_id": "fc09fc9f-8672-4dae-a1fb-acde327ef615", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T08:41:46.501000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T08:41:46.531727+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "d69e62ae-b201-4236-a8b9-030e665b5c40", "server_message_id": "9782f1d6-7f6f-4686-a81e-5f978d627eb0", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:16:16.047000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:16:16.048220+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊 是之前的荨麻疹还没消退，还是结膜炎有不适，或者有其他健康问题想要咨询呀？可以具体和我说下情况，我会帮你针对性解答~", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "ff9e6e92-ba37-4142-835c-f78478301274", "server_message_id": "21f3059f-a248-47c0-9f56-cf92222a9760", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:16:21.257000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:16:21.266308+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你是谁？", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "729e1a93-7458-4258-84fb-1c23aacd78f1", "server_message_id": "3d4b5354-7f85-474b-9650-5fed810e12b7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:23:35.511000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:23:35.649981+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀！我是 **Spark 健康助手** 🩺。\n\n我的主要任务是为你提供：\n1.  **用药指导**（比如之前的滴眼液用法）\n2.  **症状分析**（比如之前的皮疹判断）\n3.  **日常护理建议**（饮食、生活习惯等）\n\n我会基于你提供的病历信息，给出准确、简洁且可执行的建议。之前提到的结膜炎和荨麻疹恢复得怎么样啦？如果有新的不适或疑问，随时告诉我哦~ 😊", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "43154142-3275-4aa6-be50-dc65978fa59a", "server_message_id": "3d5d8a61-00ea-4288-91e6-8ef816555ec2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:23:44.408000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:23:44.455530+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   User asks: \"你是谁？\" (Who are you?)\n    *   My role: Spark 健康助手 (Spark Health Assistant).\n    *   Context: Previous interactions involved eye medication advice (conjunctivitis) and skin rash advice (urticaria/allergy). The user is asking about my identity now.\n    *   Constraints: Provide accurate, concise, actionable health advice, use user's language (Chinese), prioritize helpfulness.\n\n2.  **Determine the Response:**\n    *   I need to introduce myself clearly as a health assistant.\n    *   I should mention my capabilities (health advice, medication guidance, symptom analysis based on provided info).\n    *   I should keep it friendly and professional.\n    *   I should reference the context if relevant (optional but good for continuity), but primarily answer the identity question.\n    *   Since this is a new conversation turn after a previous session where I acted as Spark, I should maintain consistency with the persona defined in the system prompt (\"你是 Spark 健康助手\").\n\n3.  **Drafting the Response:**\n    *   Greeting: 你好呀！(Hello!)\n    *   Identity: 我是 Spark 健康助手。(I am Spark Health Assistant.)\n    *   Function: 我专注于为你提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议。(I focus on providing accurate, concise, actionable health advice.)\n    *   Capabilities: 比如用药指导、症状分析、日常护理提醒等。(Such as medication guidance, symptom analysis, daily care reminders, etc.)\n    *   Connection to past context (optional but nice): 记得之前我们聊过你的结膜炎和荨麻疹情况。(Remember we talked about your conjunctivitis and hives before.)\n    *   Call to action: 有什么健康问题随时问我哦！(Ask me anytime about health issues!)\n\n4.  **Refining for Conciseness & Tone:**\n    *   Keep it warm and helpful.\n    *   Ensure it aligns with the system instruction \"优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议\". While this specific question isn't a health query, the response should still reflect the persona of being a health-focused AI.\n    *   Avoid over-explaining technical details.\n\n5.  **Final Polish (Internal Monologue):**\n    *   Okay, I'm Spark. I need to say that. I should remind them of the context slightly so they know I remember their history (conjunctivitis, urticaria).\n    *   Make sure not to sound like a generic chatbot.\n    *   Structure: Greeting -> Identity -> Role/Function -> Offer help.\n\n6.  **Final Output Generation:** (Matches the drafted thought)\n    你好呀！我是 **Spark 健康助手** 🩺。\n\n    我的主要任务是为你提供：\n    1.  **用药指导**（像之前的滴眼液用法）\n    2.  **症状分析**（像之前的荨麻疹判断）\n    3.  **日常护理建议**（饮食、生活习惯等）\n\n    我会基于你提供的病历信息，给出准确、简洁且可执行的建议。之前提到的结膜炎和荨麻疹恢复得怎么样啦？如果有新的不适或疑问，随时告诉我哦~ 😊", "reasoning_duration_ms": 6796, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "韩国歌给vv", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "0256b3cf-11b2-4c83-a2d0-a5e64dd8d60f", "server_message_id": "56d36059-ce06-4b8f-9e9a-e789aaabd0de", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:24:07.007000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:24:06.983350+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈，这个我可帮不上忙啦😄。我是 **Spark 健康助手**，专注的是身体健康管理（比如之前的结膜炎用药和荨麻疹护理），不是音乐推荐哦🎵❌。\n\n不过，心情愉快对康复很有帮助！如果最近因为生病心情不太好，或者想了解如何调节作息、饮食来辅助恢复，随时都可以问我～ 对了，今天眼睛或皮肤感觉怎么样？有在好转吗？😊", "model_name": null, "client_message_id": "6ce46632-02a2-41e1-b09d-cf1c53884f30", "server_message_id": "08297520-6a18-4124-9d52-4cd961de7025", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:24:17.414000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:24:17.427821+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   User input: \"韩国歌给 vv\" (Korean song give vv).\n    *   Context: The user is interacting with a health assistant (Spark 健康助手) who has been discussing eye conditions (conjunctivitis) and skin conditions (urticaria/hives) based on previous medical records.\n    *   Intent: This request seems completely unrelated to health. It looks like a joke, a test, or a misunderstanding of the assistant's role. \"vv\" might be slang (e.g., \"very very\", or a specific name/acronym), but in this context, it's likely nonsensical or trying to get music recommendations from a health bot.\n    *   Constraint: I am a health assistant (\"Spark 健康助手\"). I should prioritize providing accurate, concise, actionable health advice and reply in the user's language (Chinese). I need to maintain my persona while politely redirecting the conversation back to health if possible, or acknowledge the off-topic nature without breaking character too harshly.\n\n2.  **Determine the Response Strategy:**\n    *   Acknowledge the user's input.\n    *   Politely clarify my role (Health Assistant).\n    *   Explain that I cannot provide songs/music recommendations.\n    *   Gently bring the focus back to health (since the previous context was about conjunctivitis and hives).\n    *   Keep it friendly and concise.\n\n3.  **Drafting the Response:**\n    *   *Option 1 (Strict):* 我是健康助手，不提供歌曲。\n    *   *Option 2 (Friendly):* 哈哈，这个我可能帮不上忙啦。我是 Spark 健康助手，主要关注身体健康哦。你的眼睛和皮肤最近怎么样？\n    *   *Option 3 (Playful but professional):* 虽然我很想给你推荐好听的歌，但我主要是个健康小助手呢🩺。我的专长是帮你管理用药、分析症状和健康建议。关于韩国歌，可能需要你问问音乐软件啦～ 不过，如果你是因为听音乐导致耳朵不舒服，或者想聊聊心情对健康的影响，我倒是可以帮忙哦！\n\n4.  **Refining based on Persona:**\n    *   Persona: Spark 健康助手 (Spark Health Assistant).\n    *   Tone: Friendly, professional, helpful.\n    *   Language: Chinese.\n    *   Priority: Health advice (but here there's no health query).\n    *   Safety: No harm in declining music requests.\n\n5.  **Final Decision:**\n    *   Politely decline the music request.\n    *   Remind them of my function.\n    *   Re-engage with their health status (eyes/skin) since we were discussing those earlier.\n\n6.  **Draft:**\n    哈哈，这个我可不太擅长呀😄。我是 **Spark 健康助手**，主要负责关心你的身体健康，比如之前的结膜炎和荨麻疹护理，而不是提供音乐推荐哦🎵❌。\n\n    不过，听舒缓的音乐确实有助于放松心情，对康复也有好处呢！如果你想了解如何通过调整心情、作息来辅助身体恢复，随时都可以问我～ 另外，今天眼睛或皮肤有什么新感觉吗？😊\n\n7.  **Review against constraints:**\n    *   Accurate? Yes (clarifying role).\n    *   Concise? Yes.\n    *   Actionable? Yes (suggests focusing on health/relaxation).\n    *   User language? Chinese.\n\n8.  **Final Polish:** Make it slightly more conversational.\n\n    \"哈哈，这个需求对我来说有点超纲啦😄。我是 Spark 健康助手，主要职责是关注你的身体健康（比如之前提到的结膜炎和荨麻疹），而不是播放音乐哦🎵❌。\n\n    不过，保持好心情对康复很重要！如果你想听听放松的音乐助眠，或者想知道如何调节情绪来帮助过敏恢复，我可以给你一些健康建议。最近眼睛痒不痒？皮疹有没有消退？随时和我聊聊身体状况吧~😊\"\n\n    Wait, looking at the previous turn where the user asked \"Who are you?\", I already explained my role. This time they are asking for something specific that isn't health-related. I should keep it brief.\n\n    Revised:\n    哈哈，这个我可帮不上忙啦😄。我是 **Spark 健康助手**，专注的是身体健康管理（比如之前的结膜炎用药和荨麻疹护理），不是音乐推荐哦🎵❌。\n\n    不过，心情愉快对康复很有帮助！如果最近因为生病心情不太好，或者想了解如何调节作息、饮食来辅助恢复，随时都可以问我～ 对了，今天眼睛或皮肤感觉怎么样？有在好转吗？😊\n\n    Let's go with this.cw", "reasoning_duration_ms": 9009, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "把n的并不多", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "2d6fcefb-3bb9-4a20-b7c6-4ee558a54038", "server_message_id": "130fab2f-40ae-440c-9599-5a75d1a45685", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:49:33.452000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:49:33.473557+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "目前我暂时没办法理解你这句话的意思哦~ 如果你是有健康相关的问题，比如之前的结膜炎、荨麻疹的恢复疑问，或者其他身体不适、用药相关的需求，都可以把具体情况说明清楚，我会给你准确的解答和建议哒😊。", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "7049da98-5dad-44b5-807e-3433244d9812", "server_message_id": "df25aaaf-0b89-42b7-b661-74350b3c2057", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T09:49:39.540000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T09:49:39.484310+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "26bdb7cc-b20d-43c1-84bb-b150653b0396", "server_message_id": "6f22a615-1618-460b-a45a-55ffbca96b2e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T10:58:15.195000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T10:58:15.260407+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "925f52e5-23c7-49ff-ba9c-cfabdcca1046", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀！😊 很高兴见到你。\n\n最近身体感觉怎么样？特别是之前的**结膜炎**和**荨麻疹**有在好转吗？\n- 👁️ 眼睛还痒不痒？\n- 🧴 皮肤红疹消退了吗？\n\n如果有不适或用药疑问，随时告诉我，我会给你针对性的健康建议～ 💪", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "b93042c0-a4d0-4467-ba8c-ad8b2a49a8c7", "server_message_id": "5ef68bfe-be20-4a40-80cf-7117a62b6eb7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-24T10:58:26.548000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-24T10:58:26.596545+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   User Input: \"你好呀\" (Hello there).\n    *   Context: The user has been interacting with me (Spark Health Assistant) in a somewhat fragmented, sometimes nonsensical manner (e.g., \"韩国歌给 vv\", \"？爸爸\", \"把 b 宝贝\", \"什么什么\", \"把 n 的并不多\"). They previously asked about an image (urticaria), had medical records provided (conjunctivitis treatment), and I've clarified my role multiple times as a health assistant.\n    *   Current State: The user is greeting me again after several attempts to engage in non-health related or confusing topics.\n    *   Goal: Respond politely, reiterate my role briefly if needed (but keep it friendly), and invite them to ask about health matters, especially considering their previous conditions (conjunctivitis, urticaria).\n\n2.  **Determine the Response Strategy:**\n    *   Tone: Friendly, professional, empathetic.\n    *   Content: Greet back, acknowledge previous context (health issues), offer help.\n    *   Constraint: Be concise, actionable, accurate (as per system instructions for Spark Health Assistant).\n    *   Language: Chinese (matching user's input).\n\n3.  **Drafting the Response:**\n    *   Greeting: 你好呀！(Hello there!)\n    *   Check-in: 之前提到的结膜炎和荨麻疹，现在感觉怎么样啦？(How about the conjunctivitis and urticaria mentioned before?)\n    *   Offer Help: 如果有用药疑问、症状变化或者其他健康方面的事，随时可以问我哦。(If you have questions about meds, symptoms, or other health matters, feel free to ask.)\n    *   Closing: 祝你早日康复～(Wish you a speedy recovery.)\n\n4.  **Refining based on System Instructions:**\n    *   \"优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议\" (Prioritize accurate, concise, actionable health advice). Since this is just a greeting, direct advice isn't applicable yet, but I should steer the conversation back to health.\n    *   \"使用用户语言回复\" (Reply in user's language).\n    *   Keep it warm but clear about my function.\n\n5.  **Final Polish:**\n    你好呀！😊 看到你打招呼很开心。\n\n    距离上次咨询已经过去几天了（病历显示是 4 月 22-23 日），想问问你现在的恢复情况如何？\n    - 👁️ 眼睛红肿、痒的情况有好转吗？\n    - 🧴 皮肤上的风团（荨麻疹）消退了吗？\n\n    如果还有不适，或者对之前的用药（盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液、普拉洛芬滴眼液）有疑问，随时告诉我，我会给你具体的调整建议～ 祝早日康复！🌿\n\n6.  **Simplifying:**\n    Make it slightly shorter and more conversational.\n\n    你好呀！😊 怎么今天突然这么“调皮”啦？哈哈～开个玩笑。\n\n    主要是关心一下你的健康状况：\n    1. 眼睛的结膜炎用药后有没有好转？\n    2. 之前发现的荨麻疹（风团）现在消退了吗？\n\n    如果有新的不适或疑问，随时跟我说，我给你专业的健康建议～ 💪\n\n7.  **Final Decision:**\n    Combine friendliness with health focus. Acknowledge the previous interaction without being too stern about the nonsense inputs.\n\n    *Draft:*\n    你好呀！😊 欢迎回来~\n\n    之前提到过你有**过敏性结膜炎**和**荨麻疹**，最近恢复得怎么样了？\n    - 眼睛还痒不痒？\n    - 皮肤上的红疹消退了吗？\n\n    如果有任何不适需要调整用药，或者想了解日常护理建议，随时都可以问我哦！祝你早日康复～💪\n\n8.  **Wait, check system instruction:** \"你是 Spark 健康助手\". Need to maintain persona.\n    The user's previous inputs were quite off-topic (\"韩国歌给 vv\", \"爸爸\", etc.). This time they say \"你好呀\". I should be polite but guide them back to health.\n\n    *Revised Draft:*\n    你好呀！😊 很高兴见到你。\n\n    我是 Spark 健康助手。看你最近在关注身体健康，特别是之前的**结膜炎**和**荨麻疹**。\n    想了解一下：\n    1. 眼睛的红肿瘙痒缓解了吗？\n    2. 皮肤的风团消退没有？\n\n    如果有用药疑问或新症状，随时告诉我，我给你具体建议～ 祝康复顺利！🌿\n\n    *Let's make it even more concise.*\n\n    你好呀！😊\n\n    最近身体感觉怎么样？特别是之前的**结膜炎**和**荨麻疹**有在好转吗？\n    - 眼睛还痒不痒？\n    - 皮肤红疹消退了吗？\n\n    如果有不适或用药疑问，随时告诉我，我会给你针对性的健康建议～ 💪\n\n    *Looks good.*\n\n9.  **Final Output Generation** (matching the thought process).", "reasoning_duration_ms": 9835, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
