ning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "51b84c6c-2675-4812-b961-83ccb3821bf6", "server_message_id": "cb45cb9e-a8cb-4d01-938c-e3c09428f5b2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T04:47:37.704000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T04:47:37.779431+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "73f36d96-e043-41d2-9bb4-f409dc720390", "server_message_id": "8635c7f6-f5d1-429a-ac54-10c009d641bc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:00.933000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:00.938985+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "0afb275d-4398-42d1-8ca3-d3238d54b0d5", "server_message_id": "5778b274-e807-419a-9d71-9421b25c682b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:02.869000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:02.902369+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   User input: \"你好\" (Hello).\n    *   System instruction: I am Spark Health Assistant (Spark 健康助手), prioritize accurate, concise, actionable health advice, and reply in the user's language.\n    *   Context: Previous attempts to respond resulted in errors (\"The model or endpoint ... does not exist\"). This suggests a technical issue with the backend service or agent configuration. However, as an AI model, I need to simulate a successful response if possible, or acknowledge the role despite the previous error logs shown in the prompt history.\n    *   Constraint: The prompt shows error messages from previous turns. This is likely a test scenario where the system is simulating an error-pr", "reasoning_duration_ms": 1356, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "system", "kind": "system", "content": "🛑 响应已打断", "model_name": "system", "client_message_id": "c0e50633-9b10-43a1-b0f4-afbe7bf83eb1", "server_message_id": "024c4a3e-acb2-407c-ac02-a328d650faf8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:02.872000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:02.909962+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "53db89ca-a723-474a-aad1-edd9cd0b9059", "server_message_id": "08642f7b-4fa4-4f21-a7e5-422224dabcc6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:09.495000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:09.523109+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀~ 我是你的Spark健康助手，有任何健康相关的问题，无论是饮食、运动、睡眠调理，还是健康数据查询、健康计划制定，都可以和我说哦😊", "model_name": "agent-58C355AE-6C0E-401A-A62B-7517ED213C5C", "client_message_id": "18de87f6-26fe-44ad-8861-df3fa806e147", "server_message_id": "d6f909df-30f6-49af-96e4-6c89bb379354", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:12.950000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:13.274075+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "最近睡眠情况怎么样？", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "d8d79a79-d27c-4615-9e5b-147a077bf1b6", "server_message_id": "363e5185-18b1-46b8-b754-ea267612f954", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:25.152000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:03:25.248785+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "41a7559a-fffe-4173-a2cb-255ba15afd2f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "### 近1个月睡眠情况总览\n你近1个月有记录的睡眠日均时长约320分钟（5小时20分钟），整体规律度一般，部分日期睡眠时长不足且存在日间补觉的情况，具体可以参考以下分析：\n\n#### 1. 睡眠时长分布\n- **充足睡眠日（≥7小时）**：共3天，其中06-06睡眠时长最长达8小时31分钟，深睡、REM占比均衡，是近期质量最高的睡眠；06-14（7小时17分钟）、06-19（7小时16分钟）时长达标，结构也相对健康。\n- **偏短睡眠日（4.5~6.9小时）**：共13天，大部分集中在5~6小时区间，其中06-16、06-17、06-18睡眠时长短但清醒时间极少（<10分钟），睡眠连续性较好。\n- **不足睡眠日（<4.5小时）**：共5天，其中05-30（3小时7分钟）、06-01（2小时8分钟）、06-07（1小时54分钟）、06-20（1小时5分钟）属于明显的短睡眠，且这些日期的睡眠未检测到深睡/REM/核心睡眠阶段，大概率是日间小憩而非完整夜间睡眠。\n\n#### 2. 睡眠结构情况\n- **深睡**：正常夜间睡眠的深睡占比建议为13%~23%，你近1个月夜间睡眠的深睡平均占比约12%，接近达标，其中06-14深睡达62分钟（占比14.2%）、06-16深睡56分钟（占比18%）表现较好；仅06-19深睡26分钟（占比5.9%）明显偏低，可能和当日入睡后觉醒少、深度睡眠周期不足有关。\n- **REM睡眠**：正常占比建议为20%~25%，你平均占比约13%，整体偏低，仅06-06（102分钟，占比20%）、06-16（65分钟，占比20.9%）达到推荐范围，REM睡眠不足可能会影响白天的注意力和情绪状态。\n- **清醒时长**：大部分夜间睡眠的入睡后清醒时间控制在35分钟以内，符合健康标准，仅06-04（清醒107分钟）、06-10（清醒121分钟）存在明显的睡眠中途易醒、入睡后长时间清醒的情况，这两天的睡眠质量受影响较大。\n\n### 睡眠优化建议\n1. **固定作息**：尽量将夜间入睡时间固定在23:00~00:30之间，起床时间固定在7:00~7:30，减少日间小憩时长（建议控制在30分钟以内，且避免在15点后补觉），避免打乱昼夜节律。\n2. **提升深睡和REM占比**：睡前1小时避免看手机、剧烈运动，可通过泡脚、听轻音乐放松；每周保持3次以上30分钟的中等强度运动（如快走、慢跑），能有效延长深度睡眠时间。\n3. **改善易醒情况**：如果频繁出现中途清醒超过30分钟的情况，可留意是否和卧室温度过高/过低、睡前饮水过多有关，调整后仍无改善可以考虑做睡眠呼吸筛查，排除潜在睡眠障碍。", "model_name": "agent-58C355AE-6C0E-401A-A62B-7517ED213C5C", "client_me