INFO 2026-04-25 16:25:46,679 accounts.api_io [request_id=09C2719A-38B8-4358-B2C6-EA8C3C0DF311] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=7 bytes=2044 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjVUMDU6MzQ6MDQuNzIwNzc5KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxNjMyIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "6a7fd15e-aeda-4ced-bff5-ed095f3795ba", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "76289196-9cca-4ef4-8849-1893f8d56b3d", "server_message_id": "07a5efec-6bfe-4f87-912c-47ebf8d9ef31", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:34:02.375000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:34:02.465241+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "6a7fd15e-aeda-4ced-bff5-ed095f3795ba", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！👋 我是 Spark 健康助手～\n\n我可以帮你：\n- 📊 **活动追踪**：查看步数、运动记录、能量消耗\n- 🍽️ **饮食管理**：分析营养摄入、生成健康卡片\n- 😴 **睡眠监测**：回顾睡眠质量、分析睡眠模式\n- 🏃 **运动指导**：规划运动计划、查询运动数据\n- 📅 **日程提醒**：设置健康提醒、管理日历事件\n- 🧠 **知识查询**：查找健康资料、生成健康文档\n\n有什么健康方面需要我帮忙的吗？😊", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "0b66dde5-9143-4de6-ac93-6ee1762b7f91", "server_message_id": "e6e311ae-679d-4dc6-bcba-9c862394639e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T05:34:04.691000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T05:34:04.720779+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户只是简单地打招呼\"你好\"，这是一个开场白。作为Spark健康助手，我应该友好地回应，并介绍自己的功能，让用户知道我可以提供哪些健康相关的帮助。\n\n不需要调用任何工具，因为用户没有提出具体的健康问题或需求。我应该用中文回复，保持简洁友好。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 435, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
