ly.\n\n5.  **Final Polish:**\n    你好！我是 Spark 健康助手。👋\n\n    很高兴为您服务！无论是关于**日常养生、常见疾病预防、运动指导，还是饮食营养**方面的问题，都可以随时问我。\n\n    请告诉我您想了解什么，我会为您提供准确、实用的建议。😊\n\n6.  **Review against Safety Guidelines:** No sensitive or harmful content. Just a standard greeting.\n\n7.  **Final Output Generation** (matching the drafted polish).", "reasoning_duration_ms": 3624, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "ecc8a7be-34ca-435d-8d1f-81247347ffe3", "server_message_id": "7ed7e215-a4e9-495a-95c0-004ecd515b2c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:35.409000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:35.420000+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "1bbd471e-0ed1-4833-9e9b-accc80fcb76d", "server_message_id": "2d83739e-dce1-4b25-a7dd-355e42a5c909", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:39.915000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:40.010058+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   User input: \"你好\" (Hello)\n    *   Context: This is the second time the user says \"Hello\". The first time was in the previous turn (actually, looking at the conversation history, there was a greeting earlier, then some gibberish/idiom queries).\n    *   System Role: Spark 健康助手 (Spark Health Assistant).\n    *   Constraints: Provide accurate, concise, actionable health advice; reply in user's language (Chinese); prioritize health-related assistance.\n\n2.  **Review Conversation History:**\n    *   Turn 1 (User): \"把鸟尽弓藏\" (Idiom about betrayal/dismissal). Assistant responded with health advice related to stress/emotions.\n    *   Turn 2 (User): \"把 b 哈哈哈韩国\" (Gibberish/No clear meaning). Assistant asked for clarification on health needs.\n    *   Turn 3 (User): \"你好\" (Hello). Assistant greeted and offered help.\n    *   Turn 4 (User): \"你好\" (Hello again).\n\n3.  **Determine the Goal:**\n    *   Acknowledge the greeting warmly.\n    *   Reiterate the role (Health Assistant).\n    *   Invite the user to ask specific health questions.\n    *   Keep it friendly and concise.\n\n4.  **Drafting the Response:**\n    *   Greeting: 你好呀！(Hello there!)\n    *   Role Reminder: 我是 Spark 健康助手。(I am Spark Health Assistant.)\n    *   Offer Help: 今天有什么健康方面的疑问吗？(Any health questions today?)\n    *   Examples: 比如饮食、睡眠、运动或身体不适等。(Like diet, sleep, exercise, or physical discomfort.)\n    *   Tone: Friendly, professional.\n\n5.  **Refining based on constraints:**\n    *   Accurate, concise, actionable.\n    *   Since this is just a greeting, there's no specific health issue to address yet, but I should prompt them towards one.\n    *   Avoid being too repetitive since I already said something similar in Turn 3. But users often repeat greetings, so a polite re-greeting is fine.\n\n6.  **Final Polish (Internal Monologue):**\n    *   Wait, looking at the conversation", "reasoning_duration_ms": 4213, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "system", "kind": "system", "content": "🛑 响应已打断", "model_name": "system", "client_message_id": "7ae01849-4732-4ed0-9eaa-ff158c7e0a0d", "server_message_id": "b53c1dde-c18f-4c20-945f-0e2739ebe8c5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:39.915000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:40.018272+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id"