elated question.\n\n2.  **Determine the appropriate response:**\n    *   The input is incomplete. I should politely ask for clarification while maintaining my identity as a health assistant.\n    *   I shouldn't assume they are attacking me personally unless there's clear evidence, but \"你不\" suggests they might be trying to say something like \"You're not a real doctor\" or \"You don't know...\".\n    *   Best approach: Acknowledge the interruption/incomplete sentence, reiterate my purpose, and encourage them to share their health concerns.\n    *   Keep it friendly and supportive.\n\n3.  **Drafting the response:**\n    *   Option 1 (Direct): 你说得对，我不是医生。但我可以提供健康信息。(Too defensive)\n    *   Option 2 (Helpful): 您好，您是想说“你不是...\"吗？请问有什么健康问题可以帮您解答？(Better)\n    *   Option 3 (Concise & Role-focused): 您好！我注意到您的话还没说完。我是 Spark 健康助手，如果您有关于身体健康、饮食运动等方面的疑问，欢迎随时告诉我，我会尽力提供帮助。😊 (Good balance)\n\n4.  **Refining based on system instructions:**\n    *   \"优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议\" - Since there's no specific health query, I can't provide advice yet. But I must stay in character.\n    *   \"使用用户语言回复\" - Chinese.\n    *   Tone: Professional, empathetic.\n\n5.  **Final Decision:**\n    *   Politely point out the sentence seems incomplete.\n    *   Re-state my function.\n    *   Invite them to share their health needs.\n\n    *Draft:* 您好，看起来您的消息还没有发完呢？我是 Spark 健康助手。如果您有关于身体不适、健康管理或生活方式的疑问，请随时告诉我，我会为您提供专业、实用的建议。\n\n6.  **Review against constraints:**\n    *   Accurate? Yes.\n    *   Concise? Yes.\n    *   Actionable? Yes (invite them to ask).\n    *   Language? Chinese.\n\n    *Wait, looking at previous turns:* The user seems to be testing boundaries or typing randomly. \"把鸟尽弓藏\" (idiom), \"把 b 哈哈哈韩国\" (nonsense), \"你好\" (hello), \"你好\" (hello), \"你不\" (you not).\n    *   Maybe they want to ask \"你不是医生吧\" (You're not a doctor right?) or \"你不回答吗\" (Won't you answer?).\n    *   I should remain calm and helpful.\n\n    *Revised Draft:* 您好，您的输入似乎没有完成。我是 Spark 健康助手，专注于提供科学、实用的健康建议。如果您有身体上的不适或健康方面的困惑，欢迎详细描述，我会尽力为您解答。\n\n    *Let's make it slightly warmer.*\n\n    *Final Polish:* 您好，您的消息好像没发完哦。我是 Spark 健康助手，随时准备为您提供健康支持。无论是睡眠、饮食还是运动方面的疑问，都可以直接告诉我，我会给您准确、可执行的建议。😊\n\n7.  **Output Generation** (matching the thought process).\n\n    *Self-Correction during generation:* Keep it very short and focused on inviting the health query.\n\n    *Final Plan:*\n    1. Acknowledge the incomplete input.\n    2. Reiterate role.\n    3. Invite health query.\n\n    *Wait, one more thing:* The system prompt says \"这是小明星\" (This is Little Star) at the very beginning, but then defines me as \"Spark 健康助手\". I should follow the \"Spark 健康助手\" persona defined in the system instruction block (\"你是 Spark 健康助手...\"). The \"这是小明星\" might be a leftover from a different context or a test. I will stick to the \"Spark 健康助手", "reasoning_duration_ms": 9310, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "system", "kind": "system", "content": "🛑 响应已打断", "model_name": "system", "client_message_id": "b41c7ccf-a740-46e2-bd0c-816049c37f82", "server_message_id": "4f8b83ce-f46e-4682-8869-d622bcc4aab6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:52.969000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:21:53.128147+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好吧", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "9a4281b1-c0b6-4a9c-883f-f3418532fa5c", "server_message_id": "627a94c2-a29e-4540-8547-336984b031bb", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:22:03.290000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:22:03.362380+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_