reated_at": "2026-04-25T06:22:15.432000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:22:15.660295+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户现在输入的是“怒火”，首先得关联情绪相关的健康问题对吧？首先说经常怒火上头对身体的危害，比如伤肝、升血压、还可能引发心血管问题，还有对睡眠、情绪状态的影响对吧？然后要给可执行的缓解方法对吧？", "reasoning_duration_ms": 1901, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "system", "kind": "system", "content": "🛑 响应已打断", "model_name": "system", "client_message_id": "66878453-1ec9-4573-89b3-c1148fb20366", "server_message_id": "9d939771-9486-4711-809f-c63cba42e8d4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:22:15.434000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:22:15.669687+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哦好", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "7c5a0fc7-5588-4db1-bd03-454302322564", "server_message_id": "c86063ab-3c52-4465-9dcc-2e8147528330", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:23:05.517000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:23:05.566195+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4ca06292-a46f-40cc-bf05-317e1500e7b1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "好的！😊 我在呢～\n\n如果你有任何健康方面的问题，比如：\n- 🍎 **饮食营养** - 怎么吃更健康？\n- 🏃 **运动健身** - 如何制定锻炼计划？\n- 😴 **睡眠休息** - 失眠怎么办？\n- 💊 **常见不适** - 感冒、头痛怎么处理？\n- 📊 **体检报告** - 指标怎么看？\n\n都可以随时问我！有什么想了解的吗？", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "187170c5-17dc-4b8b-a183-4648543c1ce0", "server_message_id": "4d1f43eb-aaaf-4f67-82b8-84115296ebce", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:23:07.698000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:23:07.685273+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户输入了\"哦好\"，这是一个简单的确认或回应。看起来对话可能还在继续，但没有提出具体的健康问题或疑问。\n\n我应该友好地回应，并保持开放的态度邀请用户提出任何健康相关的问题。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 458, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
