INFO 2026-04-25 16:25:47,524 accounts.api_io [request_id=90E9A607-244C-42B8-93A7-1864C4CA7EED] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=8 bytes=36983 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjVUMTY6MTQ6NTkuOTgzMDg4KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxNzM0In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "皮肤起疹子了 帮我看看", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "d86471e9-027d-4c79-ab54-17beed4f08d8", "server_message_id": "4cadea7a-4fe8-41cc-bab9-e30bc93f937f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:15.806000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:15.917690+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请您点击卡片上传皮疹部位的清晰照片，最好同时补充以下信息帮您进一步判断：\n1. 疹子出现多久了、有没有瘙痒/疼痛/发热等伴随症状\n2. 近期有没有接触新的护肤品、食物、药物，或者去过草丛/树林等特殊环境\n3. 本身有没有过敏史、其他基础疾病", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "1fbf3f00-c423-4690-9bf1-955bf882d5e6", "server_message_id": "2dc4203e-e337-41ee-b18a-f349733db5d9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:22.909000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:23.226746+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "5FFE2BDC-425F-4846-93F8-86E4F597E644", "text": "show_custom_message_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "C4AA8670-641F-4419-B674-A98F12337476", "text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（skin_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "2B60ABE3-B64A-43F0-B2D1-4E4B677FF77A", "text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "D748BABB-F4DB-47C1-9680-2497DA2661F2", "text": "已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（skin_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "48776521-7694-4904-98B3-CA012DEDA709", "text": "{\"cardType\":\"skin_photo\"}", "type": "capture_message_card"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "a909b73f-04a5-442e-baf4-ec12890eca96", "server_message_id": "cc53f9c0-de0c-49c3-9326-ed78782d7f7d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:35.442000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:35.601829+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "69808407-B11F-47C5-9110-872CD21AF009", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260425/4F704A73-772C-4A73-BC45-CBC814C68646/IMG_1806.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 321, "fileMd5": "4890f149d00377b5e0fbbceee9bdf375", "fullCacheKey": "4f704a73-772c-4a73-bc45-cbc814c68646/IMG_1806.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "从照片看是大片水肿性红色风团样皮疹，高度符合**荨麻疹（风疹块）**的典型表现，多由过敏诱发，给您分情况给出建议：\n\n### 紧急处理（先做）\n1.  如果现在同时有胸闷、嗓子发紧、呼吸困难、头晕心慌，立刻打120急救，这是严重过敏反应的信号\n2.  只有皮疹+瘙痒的话，优先口服二代抗组胺药（氯雷他定/西替利嗪/依巴斯汀任选一种，按说明书吃，多数人1-2小时内皮疹会逐渐消退）\n3.  别抓、别用热水烫洗，暂时不吃海鲜、辛辣、酒精类食物，停用近期新加的护肤品/可疑药物\n\n### 后续建议\n- 服药后1~2小时皮疹完全消退、没有其他不舒服，可以先观察，若后续反复复发建议到皮肤科查过敏原\n- 要是吃药后皮疹没退、瘙痒加重，或者出现发热、关节痛、皮疹超过24小时不消退，及时去皮肤科就诊，排查感染性荨麻疹或其他红斑性皮肤病", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "c7bbb974-d16c-4edd-a959-d75f83726887", "server_message_id": "63deb707-566c-4eeb-a741-03bbb0be1a14", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:45.498000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:40:45.662412+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么部位 正常吗？", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "a937abe0-23b9-4cf3-8cf9-61b108aab335", "server_message_id": "eaa8dcb3-58b3-4bd0-a510-dcb1b0cd6a9f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:41:11.857000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:41:12.242681+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "325866C0-400E-444D-9C0F-C338653DC085", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260425/FA7C145D-5780-494B-8575-0ED7D97B76CD/%E6%8B%8D%E6%91%84%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87", "type": "image", "fileId": 322, "fileMd5": "f898460be7e92219373d30cb288a5be5", "fullCacheKey": "fa7c145d-5780-494b-8575-0ed7d97b76cd/拍摄照片"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是**大腿（膝关节上方的大腿前侧区域）**，皮肤整体状态基本正常，两处小异常都是很常见的良性表现：\n1.  上方偏黄的淡斑是陈旧性淤青消退期的表现（之前磕碰后红细胞分解吸收的正常过程，不用处理，1-2周会自己消）\n2.  皮肤下隐约可见的淡青色纹路是皮下浅表静脉，皮肤偏白的人会更明显，属于完全正常的生理结构，不是疾病。\n\n如果这个部位没有疼痛、瘙痒、凸起肿块，完全不需要担心~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "e9ebcdba-e542-46de-a3e1-fa50410897e6", "server_message_id": "db41dcc9-2b88-43d0-b860-b348bdd0ac6b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:41:21.716000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:41:21.821019+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "寻麻疹可以吃这个药吗？", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "9af4faf4-fa89-45cd-84ce-4df095f0c689", "server_message_id": "b235f98a-eee8-4ff4-bb66-0e2a94df8526", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at