n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\nOpto\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3mg （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "fileId": 325, "fileMd5": "de257a30b3e928fa067b0df812b1f8cb", "fullCacheKey": "671c4def-5677-4a8a-ac0c-ab843e6064ff/IMG_1812.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已为您提取用药单信息并生成结构化用药卡片，具体用药核对如下：\n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）**：规格5ml:5mg，1盒，每次1滴，每日4次滴眼，用于缓解结膜炎的炎症反应。\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）**：规格6ml:3mg（0.05%），1盒，每次1滴，每日2次滴眼，用于抗过敏缓解眼痒/充血等不适；特别注意：开启瓶封后最多使用4周，过期请丢弃。\n\n两种滴眼液使用时建议间隔5~10分钟，瓶口不要接触眼表避免污染，用药期间别戴隐形眼镜、注意手卫生。", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "7959c240-765c-4029-bfae-ffecfcf3a5d5", "server_message_id": "0153d004-80e2-4c47-900b-33f85f40aec1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T15:58:05.152000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T15:58:05.277071+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "4F86A3E8-0D48-46F7-898D-C09062229579", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "79B07280-BD6B-41AC-9DCA-5E4B7DE34010", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "2E303A34-F185-42C3-B44E-72CD93839E62", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "A9F37B28-CC55-43A9-8721-31273E4D2A9A", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "拍照", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "6e84d5a4-1fa3-4d6c-b1c4-cccfbff69862", "server_message_id": "c92890b1-9d70-4f3e-8c3d-432aac978a47", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:01.738000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:01.989699+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请您点击上方的拍照卡片，对准药盒的正面（有药品名称、规格的一面）拍摄清晰照片，我会帮您核对药品信息、用法用量，以及和当前处方的匹配度~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "18d1f884-d779-42f8-bb9d-aad7141ef50b", "server_message_id": "f1b4e7ca-e292-45d3-8bf6-2cf153fc310a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:10.522000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:10.764564+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "65E802B2-E63C-4AB5-AFDD-A2CB64BCCDEA", "text": "show_custom_message_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "D818E9EE-9EC1-4383-8AB1-9F54EF59138C", "text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（medicine_box_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "309FE71C-461B-4C65-AA63-A03F74CB1AA7", "text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "4D16831B-0612-4CF9-B32F-0D56D28D46A6", "text": "已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（medicine_box_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "08B589B0-FF12-4D40-AB83-377DB8EC1322", "text": "{\"cardType\":\"medicine_box_photo\"}", "type": "capture_message_card"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "怎么这么补水保湿", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "fcc012ed-4522-40cd-9c97-cc7622a3891d", "server_message_id": "e33a9fae-a526-4b70-b8ef-02c1540e446b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:22.923000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:23.141339+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "如果是日常皮肤补水保湿，给您一套通用且高效的方法，不同肤质可以按需调整：\n### 基础步骤（干皮/中性皮适用）\n1. **清洁：选温和氨基酸洁面，避免皂基类（尤其是晨间可以只用温水洗，减少油脂被过度清洁\n2. **补水：洗完脸30秒内拍爽肤水/化妆水，干燥时可以湿敷3分钟（不要超过5分钟，避免反而脱水）\n3. **锁水：后续涂精华+乳液/面霜，干皮选封闭性强的面霜（含神经酰胺、角鲨烷、凡士林成分优先），油皮选清爽型乳液\n4. **加强：每周敷2~3次补水面膜，每次15分钟，敷完立刻涂面霜锁水\n\n### 针对性技巧\n- **敏感肌**：避开含酒精、香精、果酸的产品，优先选医用修护敷料/保湿霜，减少复杂叠加\n- **油皮混油皮**：不要过度清洁，选清爽控油型保湿乳，避免闷痘\n- **急救补水**：如果皮肤干燥爆皮，可以厚涂一层保湿面霜敷15分钟，再擦去多余部分，立刻缓解干燥\n\n如果是其他部位（比如眼部、唇部）的保湿需求，也可以告诉我，给你更针对性的方案~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "fa69c952-7f9c-4e7f-b039-9e4e0ef7a983", "server_message_id": "a4cf53e0-a375-4d57-9881-be3ca85f56f7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:35.378000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:09:35.516897+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "生成知识库文档", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "5d164569-7009-4da4-9e4c-fe0a5d65f986", "server_message_id": "f88d283b-3077-4b33-b746-105af6430bfb", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:14:43.640000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:14:43.937898+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "7f0741c6-fcc4-4534-9d9f-f8885d00bb04", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已为您生成知识库文档草稿「皮肤补水保湿全指南」，您可以点击下方知识卡的「保存」按钮，将其存入个人知识库，后续需要时可随时查阅、编辑内容~\n\n如果需要补充其他肤质、特定部位（如眼部、唇部）的保湿技巧，也可以随时告诉我哦😊", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "1e257082-91c3-4d5a-bed7-514325b6a14e", "server_message_id": "b6e5dbaf-bd33-4685-962f-4720190ad94a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:14:59.768000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:14:59.983088+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "7B9F0CC2-5E67-494B-A17B-186DDEE7C33E", "text": "create_knowledge_document", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "92E98E90-DE56-4108-9B0E-9884A3F5605D", "text": "[1] create_knowledge_document\n已生成知识库文档草稿「皮肤补水保湿全指南」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "F35F2FD7-DD6E-41BD-A005-154C634DA43A", "text": "正在使用工具：create_knowledge_document", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "8E3ADEFC-2927-4315-815D-F0B3B062DF9D", "text": "已生成知识库文档草稿「皮肤补水保湿全指南」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "79C09D51-6B9B-497A-AE4A-CD4C5C757ECC", "text": "[{\"content\":\"# 皮肤补水保湿全指南\\n## 基础通用步骤（干皮\\/中性皮适用）\\n1. **清洁**：选用温和氨基酸洁面，避免皂基类产品；晨间可仅用温水清洁，减少油脂过度流失。\\n2. **即时补水**：洗完脸30秒内涂抹爽肤水\\/化妆水，干燥时可湿敷3分钟（单次不超过5分钟，避免皮肤反向脱水）。\\n3. **锁水防护**：后续叠加精华+乳液\\/面霜：\\n   - 干皮优先选封闭性强的面霜（含神经酰胺、角鲨烷、凡士林成分优先）\\n   - 油皮选清爽型乳液，避免闷痘\\n4. **周期护理**：每周敷2~3次补水面膜，每次15分钟，敷完立刻涂面霜锁水。\\n\\n## 不同肤质针对性技巧\\n- **敏感肌**：避开含酒精、香精、果酸的产品，优先选用医用修护敷料\\/保湿霜，减少复杂成分叠加。\\n- **油皮\\/混油皮**：避免过度清洁，选清爽控油型保湿乳，平衡水油分泌。\\n- **急救补水**：皮肤干燥爆皮时，可厚涂保湿面霜敷15分钟，擦去多余部分即可快速缓解干燥。\",\"title\":\"皮肤补水保湿全指南\"}]", "type": "knowledge_card"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
