INFO 2026-04-25 16:25:47,678 accounts.api_io [request_id=3869523E-1BF2-4131-A6D8-D0992F5E036B] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=14 bytes=16793 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjVUMTY6MjQ6NTkuOTcwNjk2KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxNzUyIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "1225c5a1-ddc1-4246-978d-e02d57fb4896", "server_message_id": "bd5c7abf-2c04-4929-804b-ab044f1f3e0d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:17:36.854000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:17:37.008868+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么什么", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "d0eea068-679a-4ef7-89ac-990b466534be", "server_message_id": "c0e9164d-a5d3-4424-889c-12898448d321", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:18:41.918000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:18:42.000021+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好 你好", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "da0a8c29-dac2-4ffc-ba14-6fa1db72a16b", "server_message_id": "0855348f-dbc3-49e0-b975-5ce36de2a263", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:20:45.963000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:20:46.093695+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊 我是你的专属健康助手，不管是想查询运动/睡眠/饮食数据、获取健康建议、规划健康任务，都可以随时告诉我哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "5608c6f2-1cb8-4004-97ac-33053e1e1336", "server_message_id": "841023b6-8f56-406c-8fa0-b47cf7e5c933", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:20:48.987000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:20:49.061768+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "拍照", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "de85a260-e443-4155-ba52-c89c16e77411", "server_message_id": "4fd472cf-878a-427d-aa0b-dd2705570488", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:20:59.939000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:21:00.013024+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已为你调出拍照上传入口，你可以拍摄体检报告、药盒、皮肤状况等相关图片，我会帮你解读分析哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "d02c5be6-c775-45f9-b6ea-6548d48a0fb5", "server_message_id": "2857c8e6-83c8-4299-92e7-19eaf17362aa", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:21:07.124000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:21:07.269135+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "8EE1B531-DC47-460A-8918-38380176A8C7", "text": "{\"cardType\":\"report_photo\"}", "type": "capture_message_card"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "数据抽取", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "8abbc933-219e-4a4e-8088-0d8e4fefad3a", "server_message_id": "781a92f2-b599-49bc-bad4-f49652179762", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:21:44.549000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:21:44.756238+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "FE228D9F-B18C-4AA7-B101-24FB5512EAD4", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260425/E3614FD5-DBBF-46BC-9E2A-DD51B0A9ED95/IMG_1812.jpeg", "text": "窗口：6号\n年龄：27岁\n2026/04/20 10:11\n药品数量/用法\n1盒\nMY25-02-04\n1盒\nMY25-01-04\n苏州大学附属第四医院\n门诊用药单\n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\nOpto\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3mg （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "fileId": 326, "fileMd5": "de257a30b3e928fa067b0df812b1f8cb", "fullCacheKey": "e3614fd5-dbbf-46bc-9e2a-dd51b0a9ed95/IMG_1812.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已为你提取本次门诊用药单的关键信息：\n### 基本信息\n- 就诊医院：苏州大学附属第四医院\n- 就诊时间：2026-04-20\n- 诊断：结膜炎\n---\n### 用药方案\n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）**：1盒，每次1滴，每日4次滴眼\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）**：1盒，每次1滴，每日2次滴眼\n⚠️ 注意：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液开启后使用不可超过4周。\n用药期间如果出现眼部刺痛、红肿加重等不适，建议及时停药复诊哦。", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "1645ce2b-2b39-485b-8605-a21553b95ec5", "server_message_id": "642124d5-9f34-406e-b688-2ef04cd614fa", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:03.039000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:03.546519+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "2A9F512A-E31A-47FF-B7FE-60CD6E497C02", "text": "{\"medicalCases\":[],\"medications\":[{\"isSaved\":false,\"specification\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"memberID\":21,\"dosageLine\":\"1滴 · 每日四次\",\"id\":\"B40BBF68-7154-447C-8E54-48100C358B04\",\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"普南扑灵\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"frequencyCode\\\":\\\"qid\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日四次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"5ml:5mg\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"4\\\"}\",\"displayName\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\"},{\"isSaved\":false,\"specification\":\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\",\"memberID\":21,\"dosageLine\":\"1滴 · 每日两次\",\"id\":\"F2BC9BFE-5393-4FE7-A72A-4A8039A9CF7B\",\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"brandName\\\":\\\"爱赛平\\\",\\\"dosePerTime\\\":\\\"1滴\\\",\\\"doseUnit\\\":\\\"滴\\\",\\\"doseValue\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"frequencyCode\\\":\\\"bid\\\",\\\"frequencyText\\\":\\\"每日两次\\\",\\\"genericName\\\":\\\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\\\",\\\"instructions\\\":\\\"开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"日\\\",\\\"route\\\":\\\"滴眼\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"strength\\\":\\\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\\\",\\\"timesPerPeriod\\\":\\\"2\\\"}\",\"displayName\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\"}],\"prescriptions\":[],\"examReports\":[]}", "type": "structured_health_cards"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么什么 呀", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "b5948f3d-013b-4c58-9bbb-d85a3afdad56", "server_message_id": "0725c58a-621c-4477-9709-f5014193b2e7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:15.731000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:15.879272+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "如果是对刚才的用药提取结果有疑问，或者需要我帮你做其他操作（比如生成用药提醒、查询病情相关注意事项），都可以直接告诉我哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "c3687221-666a-4ff1-92dc-b550b4254700", "server_message_id": "c30a42f7-fc94-4faa-99bf-70c461017bbc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:19.612000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:19.701387+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "0f40191e-83e8-40b6-bc54-a297d74aee6f", "server_message_id": "8fc61886-ccdb-4c13-b3b4-832d27ccfb30", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:33.660000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:33.828349+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "88DE22E0-CAEE-4577-A2BC-085AC2AF2E60", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260425/BD50D9CE-563C-4B45-BC11-BBA75A87835F/IMG_1825.jpeg", "text": "⑦\nins fege\n电磁门頭\nCiub\n9铝\nC2\n直流天别电奶\n取走包裹请\n24Hk\n单舱洗姝 洗烘效率團\n粤系然醇霎衣盟无注付区\n9999%量\n智能投放洗涤\n高效洁净不交叉\n单洗烘区\n说热效率提升2004双能同流同；\n双洗烘\n独在双系统分区不溫流更卫生\n健康守护洗烘更洁净\n单向进水 放立牌水互不干找\n②\n为什么这择一机双洗烘？\n一台顶2合", "type": "image", "fileId": 327, "fileMd5": "6043d9b74d98d1c12a0fba40a506c8db", "fullCacheKey": "bd50d9ce-563c-4b45-bc11-bba75a87835f/IMG_1825.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是双洗烘功能的洗衣机外包装哦，这类洗衣机支持双舱独立洗护，衣物可以分区清洗不交叉，还有99.99%的除菌率，适合需要分开洗护衣物（比如贴身衣物和外衣、儿童衣物和成人衣物）的家庭使用~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "320e4f44-0c1b-46e3-90a5-79f437c68407", "server_message_id": "a8fba95d-f405-40ae-8fcf-4c479f5c2ee5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:43.358000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:43.458781+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "还不错嘞", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "0b256da6-aabc-4c4b-a413-2096d0802fff", "server_message_id": "86381fe9-5ce2-456c-9bfa-f8d81a1bd9a0", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:55.916000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:56.023680+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "如果之后有健康相关的需求，比如运动/睡眠数据查询、饮食营养分析、用药提醒设置、健康知识咨询等，随时找我就可以哦😉", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "b32e2777-d617-46ca-9d5e-b0d463859b70", "server_message_id": "778d71f8-595c-45f6-8c02-a1f7cf77f440", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:59.649000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:22:59.991834+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你在干嘛", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "5e4ecc34-7128-4546-b9aa-757267e59329", "server_message_id": "c1dcb009-7e29-4e5f-8fbc-e683ef51d9d7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:23:22.947000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:23:23.041672+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我正随时待命，准备帮你处理各类健康相关需求哦😉 不管是要查询运动、睡眠、饮食数据，设置用药/运动提醒，还是想了解健康相关知识，都可以直接告诉我哒~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "5422018d-ba8d-4ac6-a3be-410f9600efbe", "server_message_id": "6cb8c140-bfbd-4806-bcf3-efd1a132c1ce", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:23:30.872000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:23:30.958407+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户现在问“你在干嘛”，首先我是健康助手，现在就在等待用户的健康相关诉求对吧？要友好回应，同时引导用户说出需求。比如：我正在待命呀，随时准备帮你解决健康相关的问题，不管是查数据、做规划还是要健康建议都可以哦😘？不对，再自然点。哦对，符合之前的语气，就说“我正随时待命，准备帮你处理各类健康相关需求哦😉 不管是要查询运动睡眠饮食数据、设置用药/运动提醒，还是想了解健康相关知识，都可以直接告诉我哒~” 对，就这个。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 4258, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "生成知识库卡片", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "32cbd35a-de0b-4ed6-aae9-5f973c64dec1", "server_message_id": "1bd03962-c9f2-4ebb-bc3b-216fd7568329", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:24:47.855000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:24:48.052770+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "83ea944d-7291-4bae-acb4-767b52ee00fb", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已为你生成「结膜炎用药注意事项」知识卡草稿，你可以点击卡片上的保存按钮，将这份用药信息存入你的个人知识库，方便后续随时查阅哦。", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "84f6a33b-b62c-4faf-abe3-0002cb4f91c9", "server_message_id": "a456625a-35b9-4b33-8d1e-498cbbb101d9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T16:24:59.747000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:24:59.970696+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "A01C8199-3C0C-479D-8EAE-9A3E092AC134", "text": "create_knowledge_document", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "8ACBA895-7E29-4DB3-904D-C27B7FA063E8", "text": "[1] create_knowledge_document\n已生成知识库文档草稿「结膜炎用药注意事项」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "52744A31-FF3B-491F-BF87-5B5C047721A2", "text": "正在使用工具：create_knowledge_document", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "DD09C021-906F-4C43-8899-7FC984842495", "text": "已生成知识库文档草稿「结膜炎用药注意事项」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "5D8BF45D-D518-488F-8D3A-B68406928062", "text": "[{\"content\":\"### 就诊信息\\n- 就诊医院：苏州大学附属第四医院\\n- 就诊时间：2026-04-20\\n- 诊断：结膜炎\\n\\n### 用药方案\\n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）**\\n   - 规格：5ml:5mg\\n   - 用法：滴眼，每日4次，每次1滴\\n   - 数量：1盒\\n\\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）**\\n   - 规格：6ml:3mg（0.05%）\\n   - 用法：滴眼，每日2次，每次1滴\\n   - 数量：1盒\\n   - 特殊注意：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过4周\\n\\n### 注意事项\\n用药期间若出现眼部刺痛、红肿加重等不适，需及时停药复诊。\",\"title\":\"结膜炎用药注意事项\"}]", "type": "knowledge_card"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
