INFO 2026-04-25 16:25:47,749 accounts.api_io [request_id=5DEB9D51-399B-410E-B48C-67BEAF040BD8] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=13 bytes=16532 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMjVUMTY6MjU6MTIuNzUxNTI5KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxNjcxIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "孤魂野鬼不错", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "2a8b0336-02cc-446c-b5c4-c222735a9bdd", "server_message_id": "6b75feb8-aeab-4191-b3a3-b7e1b2689c27", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:24:50.200000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:24:50.217419+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "听起来您似乎对“孤魂野鬼”这个概念有些兴趣，或者是在引用某部作品（如游戏、小说、影视）中的设定。\n\n不过，作为**Spark 健康助手**，我必须提醒您：**在现实生活中，“孤魂野鬼”并不存在**，它们属于民间传说或虚构艺术范畴，无法提供真实的健康帮助。如果您感到：\n1. **情绪低落、焦虑或孤独**（可能联想到“孤魂野鬼”的意象）；\n2. **睡眠障碍或幻觉**；\n3. **过度沉浸于恐怖/灵异内容**并影响日常生活；\n\n请优先关注心理健康：\n✅ **立即行动建议**：\n- 尝试深呼吸练习（吸气4秒→屏息4秒→呼气6秒，重复5次）；\n- 联系信任的朋友倾诉，或拨打心理援助热线（中国：希望24热线 400-161-9995）；\n- 减少接触刺激性内容，保证规律作息和适度运动。\n\n需要我为您提供具体的放松技巧或本地心理资源吗？", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "0b3bb8f6-349d-478f-8980-c379843df04f", "server_message_id": "fe725098-ad85-4d01-9ece-7c25747dfce5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:24:52.378000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:24:52.447607+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "不不不", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "1b7d77fa-ce4c-45bf-8459-37ce422b2668", "server_message_id": "0b537588-a23d-4d6e-b889-b21102bf0b8a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:25.761000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:26.059708+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈，好的好的～😄\n\n那您是想聊什么呢？作为 Spark 健康助手，我可以帮您：\n\n🏃 **运动健身** - 跑步、骑行、步数分析  \n🍽️ **饮食营养** - 热量摄入/消耗对比  \n😴 **睡眠质量** - 睡眠阶段和时长追踪  \n📊 **健康数据** - 步数、能量、营养卡片  \n🧠 **心理支持** - 压力管理、放松技巧  \n\n或者...您只是想随便聊聊？😊", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "5c283a7d-2ef7-486f-9dd5-5f8a29d1a74d", "server_message_id": "ba2ded2a-8c54-4ac8-8a55-aacc28d33477", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:28.200000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:28.189208+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户说\"不不不\"，看起来是在否定我之前的回复。可能：\n1. 用户并不是在认真讨论\"孤魂野鬼\"这个概念\n2. 用户可能在开玩笑或测试我的反应\n3. 用户可能有其他意图\n\n我应该用轻松友好的方式回应，同时保持健康助手的身份，不要过度解读用户的简短输入。可以询问用户想要什么帮助。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 656, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "好好过v", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "acce2565-709c-4bca-afd6-17fb8640722e", "server_message_id": "8aaa2418-67fc-4036-ab98-632ce6c5013d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:32.424000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:32.388672+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈，收到！💪\n\n**“好好过”** —— 这句话真好！简单朴实，却是最实在的健康哲学 🌟\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 今天帮您落实\"好好过\"，可以从这些小事开始：\n\n| 类别 | 可执行建议 |\n|------|-----------|\n| 🚶 运动 | 饭后散步15分钟 / 爬楼梯代替电梯 |\n| 🥗 饮食 | 多喝水（1.5L+）/ 多吃一份蔬菜 |\n| 😴 睡眠 | 今晚提前30分钟放下手机 |\n| 😊 心情 | 做一件让自己开心的小事 |\n\n---\n\n需要我帮您：\n- 📋 **查看最近的活动数据**（步数/睡眠/运动）？\n- 🍽️ **分析饮食营养**是否均衡？\n- 🏃 **制定一个小目标**（比如每天多走1000步）？\n\n还是...就随便聊聊？😊", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "4ece43ac-d045-49c2-9850-bfba6ff0bf95", "server_message_id": "964d15cb-13c2-452a-9161-5059a1e0090d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:36.462000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:36.468823+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户输入的是\"好好过v\"，这看起来像是一个打字错误或者不完整的表达。可能是想表达：\n1. \"好好过\" - 意思是好好生活/度过每一天\n2. 可能后面加了个\"v\"是误触\n\n结合之前的对话历史，用户之前说了\"孤魂野鬼不错\"然后我回应了健康建议，用户说\"不不不\"表示否定或不想聊那个话题，现在又说\"好好过v\"。\n\n我觉得用户可能是在表达一种积极的生活态度，想要好好生活/过好每一天。作为健康助手，我应该给予积极的回应，并可以询问是否需要具体的健康管理建议。\n\n不需要调用任何工具，这是一个轻松的对话场景。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 1151, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "出g规范", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "dc25348f-c10b-42dd-9efb-f2b15606c1c0", "server_message_id": "b9f9d554-b2a4-4734-be0a-b035a4569785", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:39.971000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:39.980621+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈，您是想了解**健康规范**吗？😊\n\n不过\"出g规范\"可能是打字小误差，我来帮您整理几个常见的健康相关规范：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 常见健康规范参考\n\n### 1️⃣ **每日运动规范**\n| 项目 | 建议量 |\n|------|--------|\n| 步数 | 6000-10000 步/天 |\n| 有氧运动 | ≥150分钟/周 |\n| 力量训练 | ≥2次/周 |\n\n### 2️⃣ **睡眠规范**\n| 年龄段 | 推荐时长 |\n|--------|----------|\n| 成人(18-64岁) | 7-9小时/晚 |\n| 老年人(65+) | 7-8小时/晚 |\n\n### 3️⃣ **饮食营养规范**\n| 营养素 | 占比(总热量) |\n|--------|-------------|\n| 蛋白质 | 10%-15% |\n| 碳水化合物 | 50%-65% |\n| 脂肪 | 20%-35% |\n\n### 4️⃣ **体检规范**\n| 人群 | 建议频率 |\n|------|----------|\n| 健康成年人 | 每年1次 |\n| 慢性病患者 | 每3-6个月 |\n\n---\n\n您具体想了解哪方面的规范呢？👇\n- 🏥 **医疗/用药规范**\n- 🏃 **运动安全规范**\n- 🍽️ **饮食营养规范**\n- 😴 **睡眠卫生规范**\n- 🔬 **体检检查规范**\n\n还是说...您指的是其他内容？😄", "model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "client_message_id": "169c1680-2c3c-4f30-a9f4-7bbeca6d63bb", "server_message_id": "b0d9f1d0-ee74-4966-bfdb-a26086625084", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:45.753000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T06:25:45.773982+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户说的是\"出g规范\"，这看起来可能是打字错误或语音识别错误。结合上下文（健康助手），我猜测用户可能想说的是：\n\n1. \"出规规范\" - 不太通顺\n2. \"出G规范\" - G可能是某个指标？\n3. \"出宫规范\" - 不通顺\n4. \"出院规范\" - 可能指出院后的健康管理规范？\n5. \"常规规范\" - 最可能！用户想问的是健康相关的常规/标准规范\n\n考虑到用户之前说\"好好过v\"，现在又说\"出g规范\"，很可能是想说\"出规规范\"或\"常规规范\"，但更可能是：\"出个规范\"或\"常规规范\"——即想了解一些健康方面的标准规范。\n\n我应该询问用户具体想要什么规范，或者根据常见健康需求提供一些信息。\n\n让我先友好地确认一下用户的意图，同时可以提供一些常见的健康规范信息作为参考。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 2053, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我要拍摄皮肤zhaop", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "e61080b5-ac18-40a3-a7b6-00c401e7f2dc", "server_message_id": "91693626-5b15-456a-bc0f-1e1a97eaae1e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:30:01.815000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T10:30:01.783357+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "好的，我已经为您打开了皮肤照片上传入口 📸\n\n请您拍摄清晰的皮肤患处照片上传，注意：\n✅ 光线充足，对焦清晰，尽量呈现皮肤问题的细节\n✅ 可以同时上传多角度/不同时间的对比照片\n✅ 如果有瘙痒、疼痛等不适感，可以在上传时一起描述症状和持续时间\n\n我会在收到照片后，为您提供初步的分析建议~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "44a84d56-cb04-495a-a5f8-217deed4829f", "server_message_id": "48a78634-c484-45b5-9f20-cfda60f456d8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:30:11.154000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T10:30:11.046876+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "07405321-1AF7-4C2C-AD01-692E47B7275B", "text": "show_custom_message_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "F9D062D8-B894-4631-975A-99F89892C802", "text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（skin_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "AC3127AB-BED2-42B1-9892-AC4EED537936", "text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "E3FFF1A6-F014-4B9F-8E5E-BCD13357EF5B", "text": "已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（skin_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我把这个重新写了一遍  响应速度快很多", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "c748e124-453c-4b9a-96cf-e219afa90b30", "server_message_id": "3cce97a6-7940-4e6d-8064-f96a9fa9ab06", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:32:08.571000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T10:32:08.503865+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "太棒啦！👏 优化后响应速度提升，用起来肯定顺畅很多~\n\n如果您优化的是和健康记录/皮肤监测相关的工具，还可以顺便加几个小功能，用起来会更方便：\n✅ 自动存下每次拍摄的皮肤照片，能按日期排序对比变化\n✅ 拍摄后可以随手加症状备注（比如痒/疼/持续了几天）\n✅ 搭配提醒功能，定期拍照片追踪恢复情况\n\n需要我帮您整理皮肤问题的拍照标准、或者症状记录模板的话，随时说哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "38b79c7e-983b-4381-a613-e2e5d25c3b1b", "server_message_id": "b8660d42-5d68-47a4-87c2-fac38f2adce1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:32:15.177000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T10:32:15.082816+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我要拍摄皮肤zhaop", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "149c13e1-4960-4f53-ad15-ed5cec128eba", "server_message_id": "120226ec-549c-43bd-abcd-0a5d7975fac0", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:39:47.307000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T10:39:47.382949+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "📸 皮肤照片上传入口已为您打开，请按照以下指引拍摄上传：\n1.  ✅ 选择光线充足的自然光环境，避免闪光灯反光影响观察\n2.  ✅ 对焦清晰，分别拍摄「患处特写」和「周围正常皮肤对比」两张照片更便于判断\n3.  ✅ 如果有瘙痒、疼痛、脱屑等伴随症状，可以在上传时同步描述持续时间和加重/缓解因素\n\n上传后我会为您提供初步的护理建议参考~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "ba6f9ca4-1ebb-45de-98f7-f748d309befa", "server_message_id": "5f2492de-9a61-4c3c-af67-c19423a67697", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:39:57.944000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T10:39:57.851801+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "0CCFBD99-DD19-4D43-9FDD-BD84B92BDE95", "text": "show_custom_message_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "F405C03C-5D19-48E9-9B85-52F5E1F4A111", "text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\ncapture_message_card={\"card_type\":\"skin_photo\"}\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（skin_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "B2B28970-90C9-49D7-841B-1554302F16FF", "text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "4F0D7407-16B7-4273-A43C-73F63A827D0A", "text": "capture_message_card={\"card_type\":\"skin_photo\"}\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（skin_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "A4CE6EC8-577B-432F-A6D0-A11218C4E4C0", "text": "{\"cardType\":\"skin_photo\"}", "type": "capture_message_card"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "fdb2a974-013e-4f8d-9314-a1426faaabf4", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "📸 皮肤照片上传入口已为您展示，请您按照以下要求拍摄上传后我会为您分析：\n1. 优先选择自然光下拍摄，避免灯光反光或阴影遮挡患处\n2. 建议上传2张：1张患处局部特写（清晰展现皮疹/泛红/破损等细节）、1张带正常皮肤的大范围对比图\n3. 上传时可以补充说明症状：比如是否痒/痛、出现多久了、有没有用过药膏之类的信息，分析会更准确哦~", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "c73f96d5-ff43-4653-ab1a-96d01bc8810b", "server_message_id": "112f2284-7810-4a74-b897-aa5f30dd0de8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-25T10:41:34.042000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-25T16:25:12.751529+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
